version: "1.1.0"
date-released: 2026-07-22

abstract: >
  SynTwin is a MATLAB-based host-aware digital twin framework for the
  quantitative identification of intrinsic gene expression biopart parameters
  using combinatorial libraries under growth-dependent resource constraints.
  This release provides processed experimental data, parameter-estimation
  workflows, stored estimation outputs, result-generation and visualization
  scripts, Host Equivalent Model resources, uncertainty propagation, and local
  practical-identifiability analyses.

keywords:
  - synthetic biology
  - digital twin
  - gene expression
  - biopart characterization
  - host-aware modeling
  - parameter estimation
  - combinatorial libraries
  - practical identifiability

 